{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">大嶼山翔東路三車相撞，導致1死11傷。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">車禍涉及愉景灣巴士、的士及貨車，晚上近8時，的士司機一度被困，送往北大嶼山醫院搶救後不治。另外亦有多人受傷，包括的士乘客受傷、巴士司機和9名乘客。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">受事故影響，翔東路近欣澳一度全線封閉。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.TA.LANTAU-2100.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026aJx8oJ4CNK1787669595.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.TA.LANTAU-2100.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-25T15:11:44.895577+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}